{"condition": "9_engine_v2_full", "prompt_id": "t_fm_03", "category": "format_constraints", "instruction": "Give exactly 4 bullet points starting with \"- \" listing tips for learning a new language.", "response": "- Start with the basics: Begin by learning the alphabet, basic grammar rules, and common vocabulary words.\n- Practice regularly: Consistent practice is key to language learning. Set aside time each day to practice speaking, listening, reading, and writing in the new language.\n- Immerse yourself: Surround yourself with the language as much as possible. Listen to music, watch movies, and read books in the target language.\n- Use language learning apps: There are many language learning apps available that can help you practice speaking, listening, and reading in the new language.\n- Find a language exchange partner: Connect with someone who speaks the language you are learning and practice speaking with them regularly.", "raw_text": " - Start with the basics: Begin by learning the alphabet, basic grammar rules, and common vocabulary words.\n- Practice regularly: Consistent practice is key to language learning. Set aside time each day to practice speaking, listening, reading, and writing in the new language.\n- Immerse yourself: Surround yourself with the language as much as possible. Listen to music, watch movies, and read books in the target language.\n- Use language learning apps: There are many language learning apps available that can help you practice speaking, listening, and reading in the new language.\n- Find a language exchange partner: Connect with someone who speaks the language you are learning and practice speaking with them regularly.", "n_new_tokens": 138, "stop_reason": "eos", "stop_string": null, "prompt_tokens": 22, "latency_s": 5.427692500059493, "ms_per_token": 39.33110507289488, "stop_events": [{"t": 21, "score": 0.3585}, {"t": 34, "score": 0.2467}, {"t": 54, "score": 0.2892}, {"t": 70, "score": 0.1597}, {"t": 85, "score": 0.3956}, {"t