{"condition": "9_engine_v2_full", "prompt_id": "t_ng_06", "category": "negative_constraints", "instruction": "Explain what the internet is without using the word 'computer'.", "response": "The internet is a global network of interconnected devices and services that allows people to communicate and share information with each other. It is made up of millions of individual networks, including local area networks, wide area networks, and metropolitan area networks, that are connected together through routers and switches. These networks enable users to access a vast array of services, including email, social media, streaming services, and online shopping platforms. Without the internet, many aspects of modern life would be significantly different, as people would rely on more traditional methods of communication and information sharing.", "raw_text": " The internet is a global network of interconnected devices and services that allows people to communicate and share information with each other. It is made up of millions of individual networks, including local area networks, wide area networks, and metropolitan area networks, that are connected together through routers and switches. These networks enable users to access a vast array of services, including email, social media, streaming services, and online shopping platforms. Without the internet, many aspects of modern life would be significantly different, as people would rely on more traditional methods of communication and information sharing.", "n_new_tokens": 110, "stop_reason": "eos", "stop_string": null, "prompt_tokens": 16, "latency_s": 4.473396125016734, "ms_per_token": 40.667237500152126, "stop_events": [{"t": 23, "score": 0.5214}, {"t": 56, "score": 0.5118}, {"t": 82, "score": 0.5944}, {"t": 110, "score": 0.7136}, {"t": 110, "reason": "centroid"}], "engine_trace": {"neg_span_tokens": " without using the word 'computer'.\n", "forbidden_tokens": [" Computer", " Computers", " computer", " computers", "Computer"